    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Salvage the Ruined.</strong> You can look at wreckage and see a parts list instead of a tragedy.</p><ul><li>When you spend at least 10 minutes working on a destroyed structure, vehicle, or fortification after a scene (combat, raid, disaster), you can make an appropriate check (typically <strong>the Plating aptitude</strong>, <strong>Investigation (Mind)</strong>, or <strong>Faith (Soul)</strong> if it was sacred).</li><li>On a success (DC set by GM), your Domain gains a small narrative resource bump—typically <strong>+10 Economy marks</strong>, rare materials, or a discount on upcoming repairs in that hex.</li></ul><p>This feature doesn’t conjure resources from nowhere; it lets you recover value from places other people would simply abandon.</p>",
